      "note": "PROVISIONAL machine alignment by Codex (English-first independent proposal); GMR English is verbatim. Mechanical generation does not establish semantic approval. \"sit down together\" is a d3 recast of simultaneous viewing; it does not add a dictionary equation for literal sitting. Repeated look/looks, when/when, basin/basin and pus/pus are separately located. skra shad owns \"strand of hair,\" with only skra as a tighter \"hair\" member. The genitive suffix of bse ru'i and locative du have no separate exponents beyond the spatial construction \"in the basin\"; gyis has no separate word in the active subject. The premise enumeration, de ltar, dbang po can possessor framing and the flowing modifier 'bab are distributed and remain unbanked. The bracketed attribution [Master Dharmakirti's] remains verbatim, unwrapped apparatus; an internal attribution inconsistency is proposed as PROBABLE in errata.json, with no source correction. The next-row reply (C05:307) distinguishes perception validity from the actual presence of pus and blood."
